Subject: [PATCH 3/9] ARM: dts: sk-rzg1e: add SCIF2 pins
Date: Fri, 18 Aug 2017 10:19:48 +0200
Message-Id: <8774ee66ae478fab7d57bd9f6cd5a27981a4be92.1502962873.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
